stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Preparing: track_popup()
    Preparing --> Visible: popup window created
    Visible --> Tracking: capture acquired

    Tracking --> Tracking: pointer move updates highlight
    Tracking --> SubmenuPending: hover on submenu item
    Tracking --> Executing: pointer up or Enter on command item
    Tracking --> Dismissing: outside click
    Tracking --> Dismissing: Escape
    Tracking --> Dismissing: owner destroyed
    Tracking --> Dismissing: capture lost

    SubmenuPending --> Tracking: pointer leaves submenu item
    SubmenuPending --> SubmenuOpen: open timer fires

    SubmenuOpen --> Tracking: submenu closes
    SubmenuOpen --> Executing: child command chosen
    SubmenuOpen --> Dismissing: root dismissed

    Executing --> Dismissing: command recorded or notification sent
    Dismissing --> ReplayingClick: outside click stored
    Dismissing --> Closed: no replay needed
    ReplayingClick --> Closed: click forwarded to underlying target
    Closed --> [*]